### Seeded category ids (see README): 
###   Toys   11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
###   Food   22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
###   Treats 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333

### 1. List products (page 0, size 2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?page=0&size=2

### 2. Create a valid product -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Galaxy Brain Scratching Post",
  "description": "Tall enough to reach the Milky Way",
  "price": 49.90,
  "currency": "GCR",
  "stock": 15,
  "categoryId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "sellerEmail": "posts@cosmo-cats.market"
}

### 3. Same name again (any case) -> 409 problem+json
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "galaxy brain scratching post",
  "price": 10.00,
  "currency": "GCR",
  "stock": 1,
  "categoryId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### 4. Invalid product -> 400 problem+json (price 0, no cosmic word, bad email, bad currency)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Plain Mouse Toy",
  "price": 0,
  "currency": "gcr",
  "stock": 1,
  "categoryId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "sellerEmail": "not-an-email"
}

### 5. "void" inside another word is not a cosmic word -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Avoid Toy",
  "price": 5.00,
  "currency": "GCR",
  "stock": 1,
  "categoryId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### 6. Limits -> 400 (price above 1000000.00, stock above 100000)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Star Overflow",
  "price": 9999999999.99,
  "currency": "GCR",
  "stock": 1000000,
  "categoryId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### 7. Unknown category -> 400 (field categoryId, code CategoryNotFound)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Star Lost Toy",
  "price": 5.00,
  "currency": "GCR",
  "stock": 1,
  "categoryId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999"
}

### 8. Wrong type in the body -> 400 (field price, code TypeMismatch)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Star Typo Toy",
  "price": "abc",
  "currency": "GCR",
  "stock": 1,
  "categoryId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### 9. Unknown field -> 400 (field color, code UnknownField)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Star Colour Toy",
  "price": 5.00,
  "currency": "GCR",
  "stock": 1,
  "categoryId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "color": "red"
}

### 10. Malformed JSON -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": 

### 11. Name is trimmed -> response name is "Star Toy"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "  Star Toy  ",
  "price": 5.00,
  "currency": "GCR",
  "stock": 1,
  "categoryId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### 12. Get by id (copy an id from request 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 13. Update (copy an id from request 1)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Star-Dust Yarn Ball v2",
  "price": 21.00,
  "currency": "GCR",
  "stock": 100,
  "categoryId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
}

### 14. Bad page size -> 400 (field size, code Min)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?size=0

### 15. Delete (copy an id from request 1)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 16. Delivery estimate -> 200 (needs WireMock: ./gradlew wiremockRun)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/delivery-estimates?destination=Mars

### 17. Upstream 503 (Pluto) -> 502 problem+json
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/delivery-estimates?destination=Pluto

### 18. Upstream timeout (Jupiter answers after 6 s, our read timeout is 3 s) -> 504 problem+json
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/delivery-estimates?destination=Jupiter

### 19. Missing destination -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/delivery-estimates
